WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.814
Day 4. Finger Spaces.

2
00:00:02.264 --> 00:00:09.276
Watch first. The first one on the page is written for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:14.535
Start with job two. Show the two sentences, and ask which one is easy to read.

4
00:00:14.985 --> 00:00:21.353
Show the finger space. One finger of the other hand goes down after each word, then the next word starts.

5
00:00:21.953 --> 00:00:27.154
Job one: your child copies three sentences with a finger space after every word.
